ire on my command.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"ecf247565c78eca1eb92d6dcd70acccb","i":"c42fbe55e9d44157e3cc15fe232e5076","r":"5609902:6972598:339:2330155","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5609902","6972598","339"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Jefe, dispare cuando esté listo.","e":"Chief, you may fire when ready.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"a8111e11fe0ae5282263bb578f6e31e0","i":"283348aad20a95c171629a853b2a3dfb","r":"5179010:6467480:410:1566949","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5179010","6467480","410"],"w":["tuple",0]}],[]]},"156f9a10":{"m":[[{"t":"No confío en ellos podrían dispararme por accidente.","e":"I don't trust them not to shoot me by accident.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"e8491f690f7205a5b1bc6d3f9dc68767","i":"0746eb9bf9aed2a2013c0b62b622ba55","r":"5668356:6775624:575:2374648","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5668356","6775624","575"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"\"Si no salimos de aquí rápido, volverá a dispararme\".","e":"\"If we don't get out of here quick, \"I'm gonna get shot again. \"","s":"opensubtitles","x":"a843498694bab526d3f16425c5482caa","i":"2ecf9a3b877a76188ab8ca237fac7901","r":"5116410:6937280:210:1470141","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5116410","6937280","210"],"w":["tuple",0]}],[]]},"96212885":{"m":[[{"t":"Le disparé donde estaría su corazón, si lo tuviera.","e":"Shot him right where his heart would be if he had one.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"7cd761a8d45c77ccc464c03df977c242","i":"1341cdc6f4b67efc0682b1511607668e","r":"4872162:6569749:208:1188665","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4872162","6569749","208"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Cristo, disparé mi primer arma cuando tenía ocho.","e":"Oh, Christ, I shot my first gun when I was eight.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"45673b883c7ea3846b68d15ad2f184ae","i":"1b38e0a98e9866a9d923e98fe1795cf5","r":"5580078:6695699:556:2271724","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5580078","6695699","556"],"w":["tuple",0]}]]},"73680178":{"m":[[{"t":"No dispares hasta que vea los cuatro objetivos.","e":"Don't shoot until you see all four targets.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"60fae727eb37d7cccede6702069a05f7","i":"0fbed349c489284997f36f7b7621ca2b","r":"5286444:6780162:1638:1855856","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5286444","6780162","1638"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No le dispares, al menos que se mueva.","e":"Don't shoot her unless she moves.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"f90910d57e9b8dc18cccc74d93656982","i":"11cb1cdfcb067a1c0ec3f956c0d970f3","r":"4547056:6856969:372:779350","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4547056","6856969","372"],"w":["tuple",0]}],[{"t":"¿Cuántas veces te he dicho que no dispares al aire libre?","e":"How many times have I told you... Not to fire them out in the open?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"4309f12c5353463e67fb71036f9f0ee6","i":"2dbb1c2f60af3bb4dfee9e1c43dba13b","r":"2250912:7068980:808:2912376","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2250912","7068980","808"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Nadie espera que lo dispares bien.","e":"No one expects you to be able to fire it properly.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"39b3ffaf3cd5e811b16e332e977b1139","i":"10e52edfd6dcc660e7cef085a86e2152","r":"5003032:6592064:374:1343081","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5003032","6592064","374"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"No dispares hasta el último minuto.","e":"Don't fire until the last minute.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"99f545950b82cca7b35883bb0108ba73","i":"f6659b2737ad426437b11656c64fcdec","r":"6761248:7046661:626:4186315","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6761248","7046661","626"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"¡No dispares esa maldita arma!","e":"Do not fire that goddamn weapon!","s":"opensubtitles","x":"6e61b49e3db8d68c665a9eb243bfb545","i":"73fbe7dd34cefccd7098750eee04697d","r":"1386697:6951885:645:22410","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["1386697","6951885","645"],"w":["tuple",0]}],[]]},"390ab9e8":{"m":[[{"t":"Esa es la clase de cosas por la que le disparan a alguien.","e":"That's the kind of thing that can get a person shot.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"bf1b93a23a4fab3ddc5dabd8554c95dc","i":"48e7b9d7fb3f61f91e9e258e1a43e3c8","r":"6807348:6975184:437:4192744","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6807348","6975184","437"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"El último día de un policía es el día en que le disparan.","e":"A cop's last day is the day he gets shot.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"a08cd0d97147f79c97cc2d73d4498c59","i":"5903d05502183b61cd0bc30d4b3e86c3","r":"5990088:6733647:681:2634929","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5990088","6733647","681"],"w":["tuple",0]}],[],[{"t":"Disparan a gente inocente a plena luz del día.","e":"They shoot innocent people in broad daylight.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"3e428417b09405a9aadcc82e99665f3e","i":"e1a97aebcba7c63543bd205e05c78d33","r":"6590572:7012193:66:4116125","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6590572","7012193","66"],"w":["tuple",0]}],[{"t":"Cuando el enemigo se acerque, disparan a mi orden.","e":"When the enemy approaches, fire on my order.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"dc2228c2f5a639b2f7d0f400e237d7ba","i":"9a30a435c88a00397ded3e714ebe3607","r":"4687848:6959372:882:962891","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4687848","6959372","882"],"w":["tuple",0]}],[]]},"cf0660c6":{"m":[[{"t":"¿Entonces por qué le disparaste tres veces por la espalda?","e":"So why did you shoot him three times in the back?","s":"opensubtitles","x":"015073bb8cd513ee87ea73604499c9b3","i":"005d6a15fe3e29acc2f0066ea1c80e0f","r":"6560346:6930600:387:4098780","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6560346","6930600","387"],"w":["tuple",0]},{"t":"Le disparaste al tipo que iba a pagar el rescate.","e":"You shot the guy what was the guy that was supposed to pay the ransom money.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"cca20cb74942f87588fcd08